{"tool_name":"bioconductor-hpip","contents":["oeb","bioschemas","biotools"],"fetched_metadata":{"biotools":{"id":"bioconductor-hpip","home":"https://bioconductor.org/packages/HPiP","license":"MIT","summary":"HPiP (Host-Pathogen Interaction Prediction) uses an ensemble learning algorithm for prediction of host-pathogen protein-protein interactions (HP-PPIs) using structural and physicochemical descriptors computed from amino acid-composition of host and pathogen proteins.The proposed package can effectively address data shortages and data unavailability for HP-PPI network reconstructions. Moreover, establishing computational frameworks in that regard will reveal mechanistic insights into infectious diseases and suggest potential HP-PPI targets, thus narrowing down the range of possible candidates for subsequent wet-lab experimental validations.","addition_date":"2026-08-30T02:43:57.951681Z","last_update_date":"2026-08-30T02:43:57.953741Z","tool_type":["Command-line tool","Library"],"version":["1.18.0"],"collections":["BioConductor"],"biotools_curie":"biotools:bioconductor-hpip","credit":[{"name":"Mohan Babu"},{"name":"Matineh Rahmatbakhsh","typeEntity":"Person","typeRole":["Developer","Maintainer"]}],"documentation":[{"type":["User manual"],"url":"https://bioconductor.org/packages/HPiP"}],"edit_permission":{"type":"private"},"name":"HPiP","operating_system":["Linux","Mac","Windows"],"owner":"gh2biotools","publication":[{"doi":"10.18129/B9.bioc.HPiP"}]},"bioschemas":{"name":"HPiP","home":"https://bio.tools/bioconductor-hpip","license":"MIT","version":"1.18.0","summary":"HPiP (Host-Pathogen Interaction Prediction) uses an ensemble learning algorithm for prediction of host-pathogen protein-protein interactions (HP-PPIs) using structural and physicochemical descriptors computed from amino acid-composition of host and pathogen proteins.The proposed package can effectively address data shortages and data unavailability for HP-PPI network reconstructions. Moreover, establis